- Every requirement ID must be owned by at least one stream or listed in `coordinatorRequirementIds`.
- `maxRetrievalSteps` is an advisory retrieval-step instruction, not a native agent parameter or enforced limit. Native `toolCalls` includes other work and cannot prove retrieval-limit compliance.
- `kind` is `standard` or `current-field`.
