- Use at most one requested current-field stream and add `artifactDir`, an absolute fresh run directory beneath `/home/balauru/.pi-profiles/fabric/skill-evaluations/fabric-research-native/`. Read the [current-field contract](references/stream-contracts.md#current-field-with-last30days). Its native worker gets `read`, `bash`, `write` plus retrieval tools, invokes the installed engine, and returns evidence and actual artifact paths. Missing artifact scope blocks only this stream. Do not relabel ordinary search as an engine run.
